/td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-observation-diabetes.html#s-Observation.subject\">Observation.subject</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Reference(BePatient). The model carries the NISS; in FHIR it is the identifier of the referenced BePatient (or Reference.identifier).</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Recorder</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-observation-diabetes.html#s-Observation.extension:recorder\">Observation.extension:recorder</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>The model carries the NISS of the professional or the company number of the organization; in FHIR this is a reference to the corresponding practitioner, practitioner role or organization.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Category</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-observation-diabetes.html#s-Observation.category\">Observation.category</a></td><td>1..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Bound to BeVSDiabetesObservationCategory (698472009 Glucose monitoring).</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-be-observation-diabetes.html#s-Observation.status\">Observation.status</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>0..1 in the model but 1..1 in the profile. The model refers to the SNOMED CT code 445665009 (Final report); in FHIR this is the observation-status code final (BeVSDiabetesObservationStatus).</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">Code</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept